      "bbox": [
        48.959869384765625,
        245.569580078125,
        300.0611877441406,
        258.8597412109375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "events, which is a ﬁnitely additive probability. This is no",
