        436.4891662597656,
        300.3012390136719,
        449.7793273925781
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "as a derived notion: that when we specify a set of conditional",
      "bbox": [
        48.959869384765625,
        448.4891662597656,
        300.3698425292969,
        461.7793273925781
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
