        216.28863525390625,
        563.097900390625,
        236.3434295654297
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "deﬁne a mass function pZO on the power set of ZO as follows:",
      "bbox": [
        311.99658203125,
        228.168701171875,
        563.165771484375,
        243.85888671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "pZO(A) = EZO(IA), where IA is the indicator function of the",
      "bbox": [
        311.9964294433594,
        240.1685791015625,
        563.0198364257812,
        254.8985595703125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "subset A of ZO, given by IA(w) = 1 if w belongs to A, and",
      "bbox": [
        311.9964599609375,
        252.1685791015625,
        563.0975952148438,
        272.223388671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "IA(w) = 0 otherwise. It turns out that the functional pZO thus",
      "bbox": [
        311.9962158203125,
        264.04827880859375,
        563.1919555664062,
        279.73846435546875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "deﬁned is a (ﬁnitely additive) probability measure, and EZO",
      "bbox": [
        311.9964599609375,
        276.04827880859375,
        561.7716064453125,
        289.96014404296875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "is the expectation with respect to pZO. For instance, when ZO",
      "bbox": [
        311.99615478515625,
        288.04827880859375,
        562.24951171875,
        308.10308837890625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "is discrete, we have the equality",
      "bbox": [
        311.9962158203125,
        299.9283447265625,
        443.9375305175781,
        313.218505859375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "EZO(f) =",
      "bbox": [
        368.27630615234375,
        323.8271179199219,
        411.6571044921875,
        334.72027587890625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
