        563.2171630859375,
        382.1434326171875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "on the set of gambles L(ZO∪U), then for every zU ∈ZU",
      "bbox": [
        311.9958190917969,
        374.088623046875,
        561.7413330078125,
        395.5832824707031
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the functional EZO(·|zU) is the conditional expectation with",
      "bbox": [
        311.99566650390625,
        385.9686584472656,
        562.9771118164062,
        406.0234680175781
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
