        397.9686584472656,
        453.9260559082031,
        418.0234680175781
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deﬁnition 3. Consider two disjoint subsets O̸ = ∅, U of",
